# Phase 3.5 CLI acceptance — counting surface completion (W4, D-3.5-06).
#
# Segment 4 of 4 (host-backed, D-13): the segment-3 database has an active
# edition with derived forms and no morphology dataset. This segment proves
# the remaining counting verbs are reachable from the CLI with their rules
# blocks, and that the zero-proof verb carries its disclaimer.
#
# Fixture-scale evidence only; the full-corpus run stays OD-11-gated
# (see docs/05-followups/phase-3.5-deferrals.md).

```console
$ qai quran count distribution ويت --profile L3.diacritics
SNAPSHOT-PLACEHOLDER
```

